Package: semiautoReg
Title: Semiparametric Regression with Autocorrelated Errors
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Nur", "Kholifah",email= "nurkholifah11@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for semiparametric regression modeling with autocorrelated errors.
    The package combines spline-based flexible regression and autocorrelation correction
    in a simple R package workflow.
